{'symbol': 'CLX', 'date': '2021-08-03 06:30:00', 'title': 'CLOROX REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND FISCAL YEAR 2021 RESULTS, PROVIDES FISCAL YEAR 2022 OUTLOOK', 'text': 'OAKLAND, CALIF., AUG. 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE CLOROX COMPANY (NYSE: CLX) REPORTED A 9% SALES DECREASE AND A 68% DECREASE IN DILUTED NET EARNINGS PER SHARE (DILUTED EPS) FOR ITS FOURTH QUARTER, WHICH ENDED JUNE 30, 2021.'}